<p>You fire an incredibly potent shot at an enemy, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">135%, 150%, 161%, 171%, 180%</acronym> damage and dazing them for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.</p><p>The daze chance increases with your Steampower.</p>